<% page_title "Refund policy" %>
<header class="page-head"><div class="wrap narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Policies</p><h1>Refund policy</h1></div></header>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow prose">
  <p class="callout">Draft policy, pending legal review before launch.</p>
  <p>We want you to be sure. If a course isn't right for you, you can ask for a full refund within <strong>14 days</strong> of purchase, as long as you've completed less than <strong>25%</strong> of the course.</p>
  <p><strong>How to ask:</strong> email <%= mail_to brand.contact_email %> with the email address on your account and the course name. We'll reply within <%= brand.reply_days %> business days, and refunds go back to your original payment method.</p>
  <p><strong>Free courses</strong> have nothing to refund.</p>
  <p><strong>Consulting</strong> is covered by the terms in your written proposal.</p>
  <p>If something went wrong, such as a technical problem or a lesson that didn't work, tell us anyway, even outside the refund window. We'd rather fix it.</p>
</div></section>
